<h1 class="mb-3">Wheelhouse</h1>

<p class="lead mb-5">
  A neighbourhood bicycle repair shop. Bring the bike in, we tell you what it needs
  and what it will cost, and you decide before we touch it.
</p>

<div class="row g-4">
  <div class="col-12 col-lg-4">
    <h2 class="h5">What we charge</h2>
    <p>Every job we do, with its price. The list on the wall, on the website.</p>
    <%= link_to "See the price list", services_path, class: "btn btn-primary" %>
  </div>

  <div class="col-12 col-lg-4">
    <h2 class="h5">Visiting the workshop</h2>
    <p>Where we are, when we open, and what happens when you bring a bike in.</p>
    <%= link_to "Plan your visit", visiting_path, class: "btn btn-outline-primary" %>
  </div>

  <div class="col-12 col-lg-4">
    <h2 class="h5">Who we are</h2>
    <p>Three mechanics in the workshop and someone at the counter.</p>
    <%= link_to "About the shop", about_path, class: "btn btn-outline-primary" %>
  </div>
</div>